<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Menu — Evo Meals' }) %>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/appnav', { active: 'menu' }) %>

<div class="page">
  <div class="page-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">This week's menu</span>
    <h1>Real meals, real nutrition</h1>
    <p>Every dish shows full nutrition info — this fixes a content gap flagged in the earlier system, where menu tabs existed but were never populated.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="allergen-banner">
    <div class="allergen-banner-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg><span>Allergen information available per dish</span></div>
  </div>
  <p class="allergen-commitment">Special dietary claims — nut-free, shellfish-free, sesame-free, soy-free, egg-free, gluten-free, lactose-free — apply to specific meal preparations, not a blanket guarantee across every dish, and aren't independently verified by Evo Meals. Check each dish's own detail before booking if your child has a specific allergy.</p>
  <p class="allergen-commitment">Portions and protein content shown are the base recipe — each student's actual serving is matched to their registered grade when you book.</p>

  <div class="grid-2">
    <% menuItems.forEach(m => { %>
      <div class="menu-card menu-card-full">
        <div class="menu-thumb menu-thumb-wide">
          <%- include('partials/dish-image', { m: m }) %>
        </div>
        <div class="menu-card-body">
          <span class="tag"><%= m.tag %></span>
          <h3><%= m.name %></h3>
          <p class="menu-ingredients"><strong>Ingredients:</strong> <%= m.ingredients %></p>
          <div class="menu-nutri-grid">
            <div><span class="menu-nutri-val data-num"><%= m.calories %></span><span class="menu-nutri-key">kcal</span></div>
            <div><span class="menu-nutri-val data-num"><%= m.protein %>g</span><span class="menu-nutri-key">Protein</span></div>
            <div><span class="menu-nutri-val data-num"><%= m.carbs %>g</span><span class="menu-nutri-key">Carbs</span></div>
            <div><span class="menu-nutri-val data-num"><%= m.fat %>g</span><span class="menu-nutri-key">Fat</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% }) %>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/appfoot') %>
</body>
</html>
